    "description": "The Loyalty Expiration Notification API allows businesses to monitor and retrieve information about loyalty program expirations. This endpoint provides a comprehensive list of loyalty rewards that are set to expire soon. It is especially useful for marketing teams and customer service representatives aiming to engage customers proactively. By leveraging this API, organizations can improve customer retention strategies and encourage users to redeem their rewards before they expire.",
